<title>RUSSIA: Rouble firms to 3,564 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble firms to 3,564 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble edged up to 3,564.00 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,567.99 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Sept 12		 Sept 11</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,564.00		3,567.99</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    3.16		    0.54</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
